Rohan shows me my new desk.
We stop near a large window.
Rohan says, "Maya, this is your desk."
I look at my new space.
The desk is very clean and nice.
I have a large monitor.
I also have a comfortable chair.
I say, "Thank you, Rohan."
I say, "I like this space very much."
Rohan smiles.
He asks, "Do you have a laptop?"
I open my bag.
I say, "Yes, I have my laptop."
Rohan asks, "Do you have any questions?"
I say, "No, not right now."
Rohan goes to his work.
I sit on the chair.
The chair is really very comfortable.
I turn on my laptop.
I start my work.
